// One capture per frame (11-02: the range was one capture of its first 2048 encoders, ~20 Breath of the Wild frames lumped under the first frame's number, and nothing after):
// a capture closes at the first encoder of the next frame (state 3), is reported at the next commit (state 2), and re-arms when that report has run (state 0) at the start
