    //   by a triangle clear (clear_color_tri / clear_ds_tri) or another writer left them waiting until the submission's end, where they wiped what the pass had drawn
    //   (11-06 The Legend of Zelda: Skyward Sword HD: full clear to 0 → SetRenderTargets → scissored clear → video quad, the whole screen black). lc_land sets g_nlc to 0 first
    if (g_nlc) lc_land();
