// S2Arm (#800): the shader's sampler-emulation variant <key>_se (nvn_red.h SE_RD), run by a draw / dispatch that binds a min / max sampler on a GPU without the native reduction or
//   (11-01, gap family 31, every GPU) a sampler with a border colour Metal does not have (its log lines keep the name 归约变体: the census reads them). Not in the
//   package's library (10-29 night: Animal Crossing to its MARK and Mario Kart 8 Deluxe bind such a sampler with 0 shaders, while the whole static set made Animal Crossing's library
//   75 % larger): made on this device at the shader's first such use (se_want): S2A.Dsh writes <key>_se.metal into the fallback directory (dm_shader_se; a file a run before made
//   is loaded as it is) and it is compiled there, in the background (se_kick): until it is ready the shader's draws keep main0 (averaged, the stand-in), from the next draw after it
