// table entry in a write log (NVN_RB_GMEML, a bitmap), each draw or dispatch with such stores gets its own log from a small pool, and the host learns the pools from it: until the learned
// set has stayed the same over GML_STABLE logs in a row, the stores count as a write anywhere; then as writes over the learned pools. A log read on completion that shows an entry in no
// learned pool adds that pool (before the set has settled, it starts the count again); if that submission had used the prediction, the shadows that relied on it are checked against
